    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i guess it's easy to miss stuff. besides just the visibility of the redness, are there other things like how people react to certain treatments or even just how they report symptoms? i've heard some old medical stuff about different groups having different pain thresholds or something like that, is that actually backed by anything or is that just a myth?",
